      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the urge to take control is a natural and powerful response to helplessness, the reality is that the fear you feel is a direct result of a situation far beyond any human ability to stop. You are right to ask why we endure it, but in those final hours, the \"peace\" you seek can be a dangerous illusion that might come with a terrible cost. The only true dignity might be transforming that terror into a final act of deliberate peace for yourself and those you love, even if the end is already inevitable.",
